Tokenization
=========

This repository contains materials (notebooks and code) created by Youssef Al Hariri.

Attribution and third-party content:

- Portions of `notebooks/12_3_Tokenization.ipynb` were adapted from materials related to
  Simon J.D. Prince's book "Understanding Deep Learning" (MIT Press). The original
  notebook source is available from the UDL Book project: https://udlbook.github.io/udlbook/.

- The following third-party libraries are used by the notebooks. Please consult each
  project's own license for details; this repository's `LICENSE` (Apache-2.0) does not
  relicense those projects.

  - jupyter / jupyterlab — interactive notebooks and lab environment
  - ipywidgets — interactive widgets
